  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Livelihoods Enhancement Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural farmers are transformed into resilient communities that are food and income secure, supported by functional early warning systems, and able to anticipate, withstand, and recover from shocks. By synergizing climate-proof agricultural production systems, sustainable environmental stewardship, early warning systems, and inclusive economic development, the programme transforms vulnerability into opportunity. Rural farmers are empowered to secure their food and income, withstand shocks, and drive their own resilient futures&#x2014;anchored in faith, innovation, and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
